 "notes": "SAPPHIRES02 stimulated resonant photon-photon collider (light-by-light/vacuum FWM), null result. Headline pseudoscalar exclusion from Fig.11 (m_sigma - g/M plane), red 'This work' region lower boundary extracted from vector EPS (Fig11.eps, 0.8 0 0 c thick stroke). The paper's coupling is g/M with -L_sigma = (g/M)(1/4)F Ftilde sigma (Eq.1), which is identical to the canonical g_agamma so g_agamma = g/M directly, no conversion. Axes: x=10^-3..1 eV (px 631..1976 per decade 448), y=10^-13..10^-1 GeV^-1 (px 212..1552). Resonant valley shape; minimum g/M=5.5e-7 at m=0.157 eV matches abstract's 5.45e-7 at 0.15 eV. Curve is the lower reach boundary; endpoints hit the 10^-1 top frame. 95% CL (1.64 sigma). Model-independent (no DM assumption). Pseudoscalar chosen as headline per abstract; scalar version in Fig.10 not reported.",
